[33mcommit 33d2c44ab4e975992c83933c5aaeb100b39c10a3[m
Author: Zhi Han <zhih@fb.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 29 09:27:26 2026 -0400

    [cpp] route dynamic_cast through C++-frontend dispatch (#4147)
    
    Move dynamic_cast lowering out of the C frontend's structural-cast
    fall-through. The CXXDynamicCastExprClass arm now calls a new
    clang_cpp_convertert::build_dynamic_cast helper, and get_cast_expr fails
    loudly if any CK_Dynamic still reaches it. The helper currently mirrors
    the legacy gen_typecast behaviour so existing tests keep their status;
    follow-up patches will replace its body with the runtime vptr-comparison
    ITE described in docs/dynamic_cast_rtti_plan.md (steps 5.3-5.6).
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: XLiZHI <958689657@qq.com>
    Co-authored-by: Lucas C. Cordeiro <lucasccordeiro@gmail.com>

